86045417] [17592186426973 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186426973 #edb/ref 1071 "![](images/d0/d0785d11a903993b04ee55c7fc23f8f219280a45b66df759cbadc1d42fc8c418.png)\n\nWhat are the $xy$-coordinates of the point shown in the axes above?" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186426973 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "373c04e2-db02-5c16-a78f-083cd4605e08" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186426973 #edb/ref 1074 "To find the coordinates of the point, we inspect its position along the $x$ and $y$ axes.\n\nThe point is $2$ units to the right of the origin, in the positive direction of the $x$-axis. So, the point has an $x$-coordinate of $2.$\n\nAdditionally, the point is $4$ units above the origin, in the positive direction of the $y$-axis. So, the point has a $y$-coordinate of $4.$\n\nThe point has an $x$-coordinate of $2$ and a $y$-coordinate of $4,$ so its coordinates are $(2,4).$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186426974 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186426952 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186426974 #edb/ref 1069 "q-109032" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186426974 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186426974 #edb/ref 1071 "![](images/69/697a2ef3438aaea021f0886e1172019744c643acc4195daf126e6f64d0a77917.png)\n\nA point $T$ is shown on the axis above. To which quadrant does it belong?" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186426974 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "7df69925-7109-5250-8a7b-f9894f0d9138" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186426974 #edb/ref 1074 "We label the quadrants as follows:\n\n![](images/41/41a419063ce1bc160023de139406c6ed8f66ab4f7046f223386fc5d93dd60292.png)\n\nSince $T$ is placed below and to the right of the origin, it lies in quadrant $\\text{IV},$ which is the fourth quadrant." #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186426975 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186426955 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186426975 #edb/ref 1069 "q-169184" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186426975 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 #edb/ref 1759218604